New:
• The app now speaks Portuguese, English, Spanish and French. It opens in your phone's language (in English, if yours is not on the list).
• Change the language any time, in the menu (Language) or with the globe on the sign-in screens. The sharing notification follows.
• The history calendar starts the week on the right day for each language.
• When the app fails, we now get an error report, with no personal data, to fix it faster.
